* @title Letter counter
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix C, Sample 1
* @match substring
* @expect >>>
* D OCCURS 1 TIMES
* E OCCURS 1 TIMES
* H OCCURS 1 TIMES
* L OCCURS 3 TIMES
* O OCCURS 2 TIMES
* R OCCURS 1 TIMES
* W OCCURS 1 TIMES
* <<<
* @input >>>
* HELLO WORLD
* <<<
          &TRIM   = 1
          CHAR    = LEN(1) . CH
          LETTERS = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'
          COUNT   = TABLE(30)
READ      OUTPUT  = INPUT                       :F(DISPLAY)
NEXT      TEXT    = OUTPUT
NEXT1     TEXT    CHAR    =                     :F(READ)
          COUNT<CH> = COUNT<CH> + 1             :(NEXT1)
DISPLAY   OUTPUT  =
LOOP      LETTERS CHAR    =                     :F(END)
          OUTPUT  = NE(COUNT<CH>) CH ' OCCURS ' COUNT<CH> ' TIMES'  :(LOOP)
END
